WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.770
Here's how your fifth grade science lessons work.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:08.180
Every lesson opens with a short film that zooms
between space and something tiny.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.860
Press Play the opening and watch closely.

4
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.020
Read your I can goals.

5
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.780
They tell you what you'll be able to do by the end.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.940
Then go through the tabs in order: Warm-Up,
The Lesson, Self-Check, and Assignment.

7
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.580
Each step has a Listen button if you'd like
the directions read to you.

8
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.380
Tap any dotted word to see what it means.

9
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.020
Do each activity one step at a time.

10
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:34.660
The real data and experiments
are where you find your evidence.

11
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.660
Extras are optional, so open them
if you have time.

12
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.460
On the Assignment tab, answer each part.

13
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.460
Your answers save as you go.

14
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.980
Then write your claim, your evidence,
and your reasoning.

15
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.700
Finish by copying your Gathered Answers into Canvas,
and check What to Turn In.

16
00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.420
Each lesson adds a page to your Notebook Chain.

17
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:54.840
Let's begin.
